# Allowlist: only what the image builds read. Keeps .env files, local
# databases, worktrees, node_modules and dist out of the build context.
# Images build from the repository root: docker build -f servers/<name>/Dockerfile .
# Paths are spelled out: the legacy builder (no buildx) ignores exceptions
# with a wildcard in their directory part, such as servers/*/src/.
*
!package.json
!bun.lock
!bunfig.toml
!tsconfig.base.json
!packages/core/package.json
!packages/core/tsconfig.build.json
!packages/core/src/
!servers/fio/package.json
!servers/fio/tsconfig.build.json
!servers/fio/src/
